1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,900
On the African grasslands, dirt towers rise many times taller than a person.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,900
Termites build them by mixing spit and dirt.

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:12,000
Big ones grow up to 8 m tall.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,700
But the termites don't live at the top. They live in a nest underground.

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:21,450
In the nest, they grow a fungus that is very sensitive to heat.

6
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:27,600
So the tower has many chimney-like tunnels that move air with wind and heat.

7
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,200
The whole tower is like a giant breathing lung.

8
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:35,250
People are studying this design to make buildings that need less AC.
